«
@@ ============================================================
@@ T♂NightAtm — Mars nightside (Pathfinder) temperature, Braeunig Tables 12/13; Table 15 reused >120 km
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : Z   ( geometric altitude, length unit e.g. 50_km )
@@ Output : see units below
@@ VALIDATION (device / double-precision):
@@   0_m -> 198.00 K ; 50_km -> 154.903 K
@@ ============================================================
@Mars Night (Pathfinder) temperature  T♂NightAtm(Z); Z geometric altitude
@Source: R. Braeunig, "Atmospheric Modeling", Tables 11-15 — https://www.braeunig.us/space/atmmodel.htm#mars
@0-120 km Tables 12/13 nightside (geopotential h); 120-300 km Table 15 (day model reused)
@Validity: -8_km ≤ Z ≤ 300_km
  → Z
  «
    Z 1_m Convert 'Z' Store
    Z UnitValue 1000 ÷
    → z
    «
      z 120 ≥ z 300 ≤ And
      if then
        z 120 - 3509.51 × 3389.51 z + ÷ -0.0195 × exp 72.225 × 200 Swap -
      else
        z 300 >
        if then "Z out of range -8_km < Z < 300_km" DoError
        else
          z 3389.51 × 3389.51 z + ÷
          → h
          «
            case
              h 8.5 < then h -2.00 × 198.00 +      end
              h 16  < then h 8.5 - 1.90 × 181.00 + end
              h 31  < then h 16 - -1.70 × 195.25 + end
              h 48  < then h 31 - -0.60 × 169.75 + end
              h 59  < then h 48 - -3.65 × 159.55 + end
              h 67  < then 119.40                  end
              h 76  < then h 67 - -2.90 × 119.40 + end
              h 84  < then h 76 -  4.30 × 93.30 +  end
                           127.70
            end
          »
        end
      end
      1_K ×
    »
  »
»
